## Current backend dependencies
The project uses:
- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy (async)
- Pydantic + Pydantic Settings
- JWT via python-jose
- Password hashing via bcrypt/passlib
- Jinja2 templates
- Python multipart for file uploads
- Pandas (installed, but data processing routes are still placeholders)
- Optional email/smtp support for verification and password reset

