## Important implementation notes
- The app is already structured around a modular FastAPI architecture.
- Authentication is cookie-based and works through backend dependencies.
- File upload and dataset tracking are already implemented.
- Data processing and ML endpoints are scaffolded but not yet fully implemented.
- The project is ready for the next step: building the processing and analytics APIs and connecting them to the frontend templates.